--[[ MINOS PRIME (ULTRAKILL)  -  FE brick boss for Delta / any executor
  Built from 1x1x1 bricks found in workspace.Bricks.master_ofbuilds (fallback: workspace.Bricks[<your username>]).

  LOOK (from the game): pale bluish-white translucent body, visible veins + glowing red heart, a snake wrapped
  around each arm, a hole where the face should be, a crown of uneven prisms on the head, bright blue glow.
  Phase 2: blue flames + stronger glow, faster attacks, more snakes.

  BRICK COUNT (1x1x1):  full = 289   |   minimum = 253 (drops crown 20 and hands 16 if you have fewer)
    Feet 12 | Shins 32 | Thighs 32 | Pelvis 24 | Abdomen 24 | Chest 36 | Neck 4 | Head 25 (face hole)
    Shoulders 16 | Upper arms 24 | Forearms 24 | Hands 16 | Crown 20

  INTRO: kneeling where the orb shattered -> shatter flash -> head lifts -> rises -> short speech -> title.
  ATTACKS (from the game): Judgement! (dropkick)  Thy end is now! (4-punch combo)  Prepare thyself! (kick combo + snake)
          Die! (rider kick)  Crush! (ground slam)  Snake Throw (homing)  Uppercut  Overhead  + Blink (teleport)
  TARGET: Minos fights your target with the game's stamina system (6 stamina phase 1, 12 phase 2).
  CONTROL: on-screen pad / WASD / joystick.  Anti-fall: you are teleported through every brick every frame.
  FE: the bricks move for everyone. Colors, flames, projectiles, text and shakes are local (only you see them).
]]

